body:
- **Wool Slabs and Stairs from Minecraft Live 2026**

Finally, wool gets the building treatment it deserves. This pack adds slabs and stairs for every wool color. Smooth, soft-looking steps and half-blocks in all 16 shades, from crisp white to deep black, letting you build cozy, carpet-like staircases and layered platforms.

Perfect For Cozy interiors, modern builds, plush furniture, or colorful playground-style structures. Your builds just got softer.

> Crimson planks -> Red wool; 

> Warped planks -> Cyan wool; 

> Polished granite -> Light blue wool; 

> Polished dioprite -> White wool; 

> Polished andesite -> Light gray wool; 

> Polished deepslate -> Brown wool; 

> Polished tuff -> Gray wool; 

> Polished blackstone -> Black wool; 

> Polished blackstone bricks -> Pink wool; 

> Bamboo mosaic -> Yellow wool; 

> Resin bricks -> Orange wool; 

> Mossy cobblestone -> Lime wool; 

> Dark prismarine -> Green wool; 

> Prismarine bricks -> Blue wool; 

> Purpur block -> Purple wool; 

> Mud bricks -> Magenta wool;
